9,"(PDF) Word-level prosody in Kukama-Kukamiria: The interplay of stress and vowel reduction. AMAZONICAS VII, 2018 (with Chris Koops)",https://www.academia.edu/36929836/Word_level_prosody_in_Kukama_Kukamiria_The_interplay_of_stress_and_vowel_reduction_AMAZONICAS_VII_2018_with_Chris_Koops_,"June 27, 2018 - This study provides a phonetically grounded, usage-based account of word-level prosody in Kukama-Kukamiria (KK, Tupian), a language of the Peruvian Amazon. KK exhibits two types of prosodic prominence at the word level: primary stress on the",Kukama-Kukamiria,Tupian
